{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>I NEVER WANTED TO BE BORN A MONSTER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Evil Egg</strong> was an ecstatic twin-stick nightmare known for its\u00a0<strong>brutal shooting action </strong>and <strong>intense audiovisual effects.</strong> Infinite horrors tear apart a world of little green men, the only hope an errant hatchling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The only known\u00a0<strong>Evil Egg </strong>arcade<strong>\u00a0</strong>cabinet to remain was recovered in Eugene, Oregon, found in a state of extreme disrepair. This digital release is a faithful emulation of the original hardware, made possible by a restoration effort led by a small team of dedicated preservationists. The private collector responsible for the machine's donation has asked to remain anonymous.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CLASSIC, FULLY ANALOG TWIN-STICK BLASTING</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>VARIETY OF ENEMIES, HAZARDS, POWERUPS AND ARTEFACTS</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>INFINITE LEVELS IF YOU CAN REACH THEM</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SCORE SYSTEM REWARDING SKILL AND\u00a0FUN</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>LOOKS LIKE CANDY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PHOTOSENSITIVITY WARNING: This game contains flashing lights and intense strobe effects.</strong><i> </i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3651950?t=1746495028","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651950/b1f2f8b1391189f61566a5a84acea3e56482deb1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746495028","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651950/08b29812af3a35a5077425da6fcd677f97970